QUERY NAME: VItest3
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW TestVols.PlanPortfolio, TestVols.TestCode, TestOrProduct.ItemDescription, TestVols.SumOfVolume, TestOrProduct.UnitPriceVLAgen, [sumofvolume]*[unitpricevlagen] AS Expr1
FROM TestOrProduct INNER JOIN TestVols ON TestOrProduct.ItemCode = TestVols.TestCode;

